00:08:40.228 --> 00:08:43.503
― 狭い意味でのEmergenceを広めた論文

00:08:43.503 --> 00:08:52.902
[EN]Are Emergent Abilities of Large Language Models a Mirage?[/EN]

00:08:52.902 --> 00:08:55.466
― 「あれは幻ではないか」という反論

00:08:55.466 --> 00:09:08.995
